<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Pacific_Bridge_Company> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[37°46′39″N 122°15′16″W﻿ / ﻿37.77752°N 122.25436°W﻿ / 37.77752; -122.25436](https://geohack.toolforge.org/geohack.php?pagename=Pacific_Bridge_Company&params=37.77752_N_122.25436_W_)**Pacific Bridge Company** was a large engineering and construction company. During [World War II](:World_War_II), Pacific Bridge Company of [Alameda, California](:Alameda%2C_California) was selected to build [US Navy](:US_Navy) [Auxiliary Repair Docks](:Auxiliary_floating_drydock%23Auxiliary_Repair_Docks_%28ARD%29) (ARD) a type of [Auxiliary floating drydock](:Auxiliary_floating_drydock) and [Type B ship](:Type_B_ship) [barges](:Barges)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
