<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Pontiac_Firebird_(third_generation)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The third generation **[Pontiac Firebird](:Pontiac_Firebird)** was introduced in late 1981 by [Pontiac](:Pontiac_%28automobile%29) alongside its corporate cousin, the [Chevrolet Camaro](:Chevrolet_Camaro_%28third_generation%29) for the 1982 model year. These were also the first Firebirds with factory fuel injection, four-speed [automatic transmissions](:Automatic_transmission), five-speed manual transmissions, four-cylinder engines, 16-inch wheels, and [hatchback](:Hatchback) bodies."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
