<http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom_of_Great_Britain_and_Ireland> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland was a sovereign state in the British Isles that existed between 1801 and 1922, when it included all of Ireland. It was established by the Acts of Union 1800, which merged the Kingdom of Great Britain and the Kingdom of Ireland into a unified state. The establishment of the Irish Free State in 1922 led to the remainder later being renamed the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland in 1927."@en .
