<http://dbpedia.org/resource/USS_Parris_Island> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**USS *Parris* Island (AG-72)** was a [patrol craft escort](:Patrol_boat) named for [Parris Island, South Carolina](:Parris_Island%2C_South_Carolina) (part of the [Sea Islands](:Sea_Islands) chain, and home to [Marine Corps Recruit Depot Parris Island](:Marine_Corps_Recruit_Depot_Parris_Island) since 1915).Originally built as ***PCE–901***, she was laid down on 10 May 1943 by the Willamette Iron and Steel Corporation of [Portland, Oregon](:Portland%2C_Oregon); launched on 8 July 1943; reclassified **USS *Parris Island* (AG–72)** on 28 April 1944; and placed in service on 30 October 1944."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
