<http://dbpedia.org/resource/USS_Ossipee_(1861)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The first **USS *Ossipee*** was a wooden, [screw](:Propeller) [sloop-of-war](:Sloop-of-war) in commission in the [United States Navy](:United_States_Navy) at various times between 1861 and 1889. She served in the [Union Navy](:Union_Navy) during the [American Civil War](:American_Civil_War). She was named for the [Ossipee River](:Ossipee_River) of [New Hampshire](:New_Hampshire) and [Maine](:Maine). The USS *Ossipee* was present during the [Alaska Purchase](:Alaska_Purchase)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
