<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mini_Paceman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Mini Paceman is a three-door subcompact luxury crossover SUV manufactured and marketed by Mini. It is the three-door counterpart of the R60 Mini Countryman. It was introduced as the Paceman Concept at the 2011 North American International Auto Show, with production confirmed in August 2011. The production model debuted in September 2012. BMW ended production of the Paceman in late 2016 as BMW executives felt it is positioned too close to the Countryman in Mini’s line-up."@en .
