<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bath_Iron_Works> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Bath Iron Works** (**BIW**) is a major United States shipyard located on the [Kennebec River](:Kennebec_River) in [Bath, Maine](:Bath%2C_Maine), founded in 1884 as Bath Iron Works, Limited. Since 1995, Bath Iron Works has been a subsidiary of [General Dynamics](:General_Dynamics). It is the fifth-largest defense contractor in the world as of 2008. BIW has built private, commercial, and military vessels, most of which have been ordered by the United States Navy."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
