<http://dbpedia.org/resource/ORP_Mewa_(603)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**ORP *Mewa (603)*** – a ship of [Polish Navy](:Polish_Navy)'s [Kormoran II](:Kormoran_2-class_minehunter) class [MCMVs](:Mine_countermeasures_vessel). She was laid down on 10 October 2019, and launched on 17 December 2020 at [Remontowa Shipbuilding](:Remontowa) yard in [Gdańsk](:Gda%C5%84sk). Her non-magnetic 58.5 meter hull is made from [austenitic steel](:Austenitic_stainless_steel). She has a [standard displacement](:Displacement_%28ship%29) of 830 tons. *Kormoran* employs sophisticated [mine countermeasures](:Naval_mine%23Countermeasures) including [underwater drones](:Unmanned_underwater_vehicle). The ship will enter service in the 13 Minesweeper Squadron belonging to [8th Coastal Defence Flotilla](:8th_Coastal_Defence_Flotilla)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
