<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Remontowa> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Remontowa (full name: Gdańska Stocznia \"Remontowa\" im. J. Piłsudskiego S.A.) is a shipyard in Gdańsk, Poland. The yard specialises in ship repair and conversions. Remontowa S.A. is one of 26 companies that make up the Remontowa Group."@en .
