<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mahindra_Armada> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Mahindra Armada was a sports utility vehicle (SUV) and multiutility vehicle (MUV) based on the Jeep. It was produced in India from 1993 until 2001. As of 1998 it was complemented by the more luxurious \"Armada Grand\"; both were replaced by the Mahindra Maxx in 2001. The Armada, the Grand, and the Bolero were all intended for urban market segments where Mahindra had hitherto been underrepresented."@en .
