<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kanda,_Fukuoka> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Kanda (苅田町, Kanda-machi) is a town located in Miyako District, Fukuoka Prefecture, on the Japanese home island of Kyushu, which is one of the four main islands. Kanda is a suburb of the city of Kitakyushu. As of April 30, 2017, the town has an estimated population of 36,957 and a density of 800 persons per km2. The total area is 46.46 km2. Nishinippon Institute of Technology is located in the town."@en .
