<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Santa_Rosa,_Laguna> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Santa Rosa, officially known as the City of Santa Rosa (Tagalog: Lungsod ng Santa Rosa), is a 1st class component city in the province of Laguna, Philippines. According to the 2020 census, it has a population of 414,812 people.  Santa Rosa was initially known for the Coca-Cola and Toyota manufacturing plants in its industrial estates. Recently, it has become popular for being the site of Enchanted Kingdom, a local theme park, and several housing developments."@en .
