<http://dbpedia.org/resource/G_Adventures> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**G Adventures** is an operator of small-group [escorted tours](:Escorted_tour). It is based in [Toronto](:Toronto), [Ontario](:Ontario), [Canada](:Canada) with 28 offices worldwide. It offers more than 700 itineraries in more than 100 countries, and carries 200,000 travelers from 160 countries each year.The company has a focus on responsible travel and partners with the [National Geographic Society](:National_Geographic_Society), creating a program of 80 tours called *National Geographic Journeys with G Adventures*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
