<http://dbpedia.org/resource/HMS_Vanguard_(1787)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HMS Vanguard was a 74-gun third-rate ship of the line of the Royal Navy, launched on 6 March 1787 at Deptford. She was the sixth vessel to bear the name. In December 1797, Captain Edward Berry was appointed flag captain, flying Rear Admiral Sir Horatio Nelson's flag."@en .
