<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Fiat_Mobi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Fiat Mobi** is a [city car](:City_car) produced by the [Italian](:Italy) car manufacturer [Fiat](:Fiat) since 2016; is available exclusively for the [South American](:South_America) market. The Mobi [hatchback](:Hatchback) in the [A-segment](:A-segment) manufactured in [Betim](:Betim), [Minas Gerais](:Minas_Gerais), [Brazil](:Brazil). It was released on 13 April 2016. This Brazilian project was derived from the same platform as the [second generation Fiat Uno](:Fiat_Uno%23Fiat_Novo_Uno_%282010%E2%80%932021%29), in addition to the engine and transmission.It was created to be a direct competitor of [Volkswagen Up!](:Volkswagen_Up%21), with similar dimensions and characteristics, including the rear glass cover in the Up! since 2011."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
