<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Fiat_Idea> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Fiat Idea is a car manufactured and marketed by Fiat from 2003 to 2012 over a single generation with one intermediate facelift. It has a five-door, five passenger, front-engine, front-wheel drive, high-roof mini MPV design. The Idea nameplate is an acronym for Intelligent Design Emotive Architecture."@en .
