<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Peugeot_202> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Peugeot 202 is a supermini developed and designed by the French car manufacturer Peugeot. Production of the car ran between 1938 and 1942 and then, after a brief production run of 20 in early 1945, restarted in mid-1946. It was sold until 1949, by when it had been replaced by the 203."@en .
