<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Vorpostenboot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Vorpostenboot (plural Vorpostenboote), also referred to as VP-Boats, flakships or outpost boats, were German patrol boats which served during both World Wars. They were used around coastal areas and in coastal operations, and were tasked with – among other things – coastal patrol, ship escort, and naval combat."@en .
