<http://dbpedia.org/resource/TEP150> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**TEP150** is a [Ukrainian](:Ukraine) [diesel locomotive](:Diesel_locomotive) for [regional rails](:Regional_rail) with a [Co'Co'](:Co-Co_locomotives) [wheel arrangement](:Wheel_arrangement). It is produced by [Luhanskteplovoz](:Luhanskteplovoz). The [diesel engine](:Diesel_engine) of the locomotive powers a generator which feeds [electric motors](:Traction_motor) built into the [bogies](:Bogie). There have been four built as of 2008. One was produced in 2005 and the three others in 2008. All of them operate on the lines of [Southern Railway](:Southern_Railways_%28Ukraine%29). These are part of the [Kremenchuk](:Kremenchuk) stall's stock."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
