<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Seibu_Railway> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Seibu Railway Company, Ltd. (西武鉄道株式会社, Seibu Tetsudō Kabushiki-gaisha) is a conglomerate based in Tokorozawa, Saitama, Japan, with principal business areas in railways, tourism, and real estate. Seibu Railway's operations are concentrated in northwest Tokyo and Saitama Prefecture; the name \"Seibu\" is an abbreviation of \"west Musashi\", referring to the historic name for this area. It and its holding company hold shares of numerous bus, hotel and tourism operations nationwide."@en .
