<http://dbpedia.org/resource/SEK_class_Λγ> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**SEK** (*Sidirodromoi Ellinikou Kratous*, [Hellenic State Railways](:Hellenic_State_Railways%29) **Class Λγ** (or Class Lg; [Lambda](:Lambda)-[gamma](:Gamma%29) is a class of eight [2-10-0](:2-10-0) [steam locomotives](:Steam_locomotive) purchased in 1947 from [Baldwin Locomotive Works](:Baldwin_Locomotive_Works).They were given the class letters \"Λγ\" and numbered 991 to 998."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
