<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Zastava_Automobiles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Zastava Automobiles (Serbian: Застава Аутомобили/Zastava Automobili) was a Serbian international car manufacturer, a subsidiary of Group Zastava Vehicles which went bankrupt in May 2017. After many decades of producing different car and truck models under the Zastava brand, the company ceased all vehicle production in 2008. Since then, a new company, Fiat Automobili Srbija has taken over the Zastava Automobiles facilities, after extensive reconstruction and renovation."@en .
