<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Yamaha_Mio> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fuel injected 7,75 ps @ 8,500 rpmFuel injected 8,5Nm @ 5000 rpmThe **Yamaha Mio** is a [scooter](:Scooter_%28motorcycle%29) with a [CVT](:Continuously_variable_transmission) transmission made by [Yamaha Motor](:Yamaha_Motor). It was introduced for the [Southeast Asia](:Southeast_Asia) market in 2003 as the successor of the [Nouvo](:Yamaha_Nouvo). In Malaysia, this model is known as **Yamaha Ego**. As 2007, there were some 76,000 Ego customers in Malaysia. Together with its counterpart the [Yamaha Nouvo](:Yamaha_Nouvo), the Mio/Ego is a platform for [customization](:Custom_motorcycle) in Thailand, Malaysia, Indonesia, Vietnam and the Philippines."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
