<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Renault_Koleos> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Renault Koleos** is a [compact crossover SUV](:Compact_crossover_SUV) manufactured by the [French](:France) manufacturer [Renault](:Renault). The majority of the production is coming from the [Busan](:Busan) plant of [Renault Samsung Motors](:Renault_Samsung_Motors). The first generation was marketed as the **Renault Samsung QM5** and the second generation is marketed as the **Renault Samsung QM6**. It was first presented as a concept car at the [Geneva Motor Show](:Geneva_Motor_Show%232000) in 2000, and then as a production model in 2006 at the [Paris Motor Show](:2006_Paris_Motor_Show).A second generation was unveiled at the 2016 Beijing Motor Show, and uses the [Renault–Nissan CMF-CD](:Renault-Nissan_Common_Module_Family%23CMF-CD) modular platform shared with the [Nissan X-Trail](:Nissan_X-Trail%23T32)/[Rogue (T32)](:Nissan_Rogue%23T32) and [Renault Kadjar](:Renault_Kadjar)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
