<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Nanchang_Q-5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Nanchang Q-5** ([Chinese](:Chinese_language): 强-5; [pinyin](:Pinyin): *Qiang-5*; [NATO reporting name](:NATO_reporting_name): **Fantan**), also known as the **A-5** in its export versions, is a [Chinese](:People%27s_Republic_of_China)-built single-seat, twin [jet engine](:Jet_engine) ground-[attack aircraft](:Attack_aircraft) based on the [Shenyang J-6](:Shenyang_J-6). The aircraft is primarily used for [close air support](:Close_air_support)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
